  "ruleText": "Ncr 856.01 Bureau Trail Information. The public may obtain information regarding bureau trail uses by contacting the bureau at 172 Pembroke Road, Concord, NH 03302.\n\nSource. #14288, eff 6-25-25, EXPIRES: 6-25-35",
